  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Ezekiel 26",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wach mokor kuom Turo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odiechiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe, e higa mar apar gachiel, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobirona kama:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Wuod dhano, Turo ogoyo mahu kuom Jerusalem kama: Dhorangeye mag ogendini osekethore, kendo dhoudi mage koro oyaworena malach; mi odongʼ gunda, omiyo koro abiro dhi maber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano, ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto wacho: Akwedi, yaye Turo, kendo abiro kelo pinje mathoth mondo oked kodi, mana ka nam madhwolo apakane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibiro ketho ohinga mag Turo kendo gibiro muko chiel mag-gi mag siro lweny; abiro ywero lope momewo oko mi odongʼ lwanda lilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwandano nolokre chula ma jolupo moye tondegi nikech an Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto asewacho kamano. In Turo, ogendini noyaki,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo gininegi joma odak e miechi gi ligangla ma ok ni e chula. Eka giningʼe ni An e Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Nikech ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto owacho: Nebukadneza ruodh Babulon, ma en ruoth maduongʼie moloyo ruodhi mag pinyni, biro biro koa nyandwat ka en gi farese mathoth gi geche mag lweny, gi joidh farese gi oganda lweny maduongʼ mondo omonj Turo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jogi modak e mier ma ok ni e chula noneg gi ligangla; wasikigo nokuny buche mi giket pidhe mag lowo mogingore e bath ohingani, kendo ginimonji ka gigengʼore gi kuodi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obiro chomo ohinga magi gi lodi mage madongo mag muko gik moko, mi omuk kuondegi motingʼore gi malo gi gige mag lweny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faresene nobed mangʼeny miwuoro mi buru ma tiendegi dhwolo ka giringo noumi. Ohinga magi noyiengni kowinjo koko mag farese mag lweny gi geche man-gi tiende ariyo mag lweny kod geche moum wigi man-gi tiende angʼwen, chiengʼ ma enodonj gie dhorangeyeni kaka ji donjo e dala maduongʼ ma ohinga mare osenyon mopiel piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ombongʼ faresene nonyon yore duto mag dalani maduongʼ, obiro nego jogi duto gi ligangla, kendo siro magi maroteke nopodh piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibiro yako mwandugi kendo ginikaw gigi mag ohala; gibiro muko ohinga magi mi gigo piny, kendo gibiro ketho utegi mabeyo mi gidir kitegi, gi bepegi, gi matafare motore-otore e nam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiro tieko wendegi mag kokogo kendo thumbe duto migoyo mag nyatiti ok nochak owinji kendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiro loki lwanda lilo, mi ilokri kama jolupo moyoe tonde. Ok nochak ogeri kendo, nikech an Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto ema asewacho kamano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto wacho ne Turo: Donge pinje manie dho nembe biro tetni kowinjo koko mar podho mari, chiengʼ ma joma ohinyore marach nochur gi rem kendo ka inego ji e pinye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka yawuot ruodhi duto mag pinje manie dho nam nowuog e kombegi mag loch kendo ginilony lepgi mag loch gi lepgi motwangʼ gi usi mabeyo beyo. Ginibed piny ka gihum nono kendo ka gisiko gitetni, nikech umako dhogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ginichuognu wer moro ma giywagougo, kendo giniwachnu ni:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Mano kaka otieki malit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "yaye dala maduongʼ mongʼere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ma jonam odakie!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ne in gi teko maduongʼ ewi nembe madongo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "in kaachiel gi jogi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ne ikelo bwok maduongʼ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ne ji duto modak kuno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro pinje manie dho nam tetni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 26:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "e odiechiengʼ mar podho mari;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 26:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kendo chula manie nam",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 26:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "luoro omako nikech podho mari.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto wacho: Ka anami ibed dala maduongʼ modongʼ gunda, machal gi mier madongo matinde ji ok odakie, kendo ka analuong nembe matut mondo oimi gi ataro mar pi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abiro teri e piny joma otho, mondo idag kuno gi joma nosetho chon. Abiro miyo idagi e piny manie bwo lowono, kibudho e bur matut e kind gik machon mokethore mi ok inichak iduog e piny joma ngima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiro miyo giko mari bedo marach miwuoro, kendo ok nochak oneni kendo. Ji nomanyi, to ok nochak oyudi kendo, Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto ema owacho.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
